  "invariants": [
    "Trace read+write ACL and active route/deletion barrier on every mutation",
    "One active fenced turn per session; stable request pair and monotonic seq",
    "Terminal assistant immutable; user content immutable; upstream binding once",
    "No implicit migration or legacy/ClickHouse schema mutation",
    "Upstream continuation must belong to current actor; admin may read history but uses explicit new conversation across actors",
    "User upstream binding changes only while its own request/fence remains active"
  ]
